# AI PowerSalon — .gitignore
#
# Written Jul 28, 2026, before the first push. The repository had NO .gitignore at all, so a first
# `git add .` would have committed ~762 packages of node_modules, five built `dist/` trees, and any
# real `.env` a developer creates. Every pattern below was verified against this repo's actual layout,
# not copied from a template.

# ── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.npm/
.pnpm-store/

# ── Build output (five Vite frontends + the API's compiled output) ───────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-frontends/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Secrets. The committed files are `.env*.example` / `.env.production.template` (placeholders only);
#    a real `.env` must never be committed. The negations below keep the examples tracked. ───────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.development.example
!.env.local.example
!.env.production.example
!.env.staging.example
!.env.production.template

# Credential files referenced by the mobile/push setup — these are private keys and service accounts.
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
# BUILD_PLAN Phase 13 D (Constitution 6 §303 "no provider secret exists in app"): signing keys, store credentials and APNs
# keys never enter the repo. (The three upload keystores + key.properties committed before this rule were removed on
# Oct 20 2026; tooling/mobile/check-native-config.mjs and check:supply-chain-injection R7 refuse any tracked one.)
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
firebase-service-account*.json
service-account*.json

# ── Local run artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
coverage/
.nyc_output/
# partial output of the security audit orchestrator; regenerated on every run
# (git has no inline comments — a trailing '# …' becomes part of the pattern and silently fails to match)
.security-audit-partial.json
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ── Editor / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
branch_structure.json
temp_auto_push.bat
temp_interactive_push.bat

# Python bytecode (never commit)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# runtime export / upload storage written by the API in development (never source)
apps/api/private-files/
final-run/
final-run-live/
final-run-prev/
final-run-pass1/
final-run-pass2/
final-run-pass3/
final-run-pass4/

# a Firebase Admin service-account file kept beside the API for local runs (developer tree, Oct 2026) — a secret, never source
apps/api/firebase-admin.json
